---
title: "withdrawExcessInvestedCapital (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_guard: whenNotPaused AND whenSaleNotCanceled
    q_guard --> q_get_pos: guards pass
    q_get_pos --> q_verify_exists: positionId = _getInvestorPositionId(msg.sender)
    q_verify_exists --> q_verify_sig: _verifyPositionExists(positionId)
    q_verify_sig --> q_verify_excess: _verifySignatureNotUsed(withdrawSignature)
    q_verify_excess --> q_mark_sig: _verifyCanClaimExcessCapital(positionId) - check hasClaimedExcess == false
    q_mark_sig --> q_mark_excess: usedSignatures[msg.sender][withdrawSignature] = true
    q_mark_excess --> q_update_totals: hasClaimedExcess = true
    q_update_totals --> q_update_pos: totalCapitalInvested -= amount; investedCapital -= amount
    q_update_pos --> q_verify_valid: _updateInvestorPosition(investAmount, tokenAllocationRate, positionId)
    q_verify_valid --> q_emit: _verifyValidPosition(withdrawSignature, positionId, WITHDRAW_EXCESS_CAPITAL)
    q_emit --> q_transfer: emit ExcessCapitalWithdrawn(amount, msg.sender, positionId)
    q_transfer --> [*]: safeTransfer(bidToken, msg.sender, amount) if amount > 0

    note right of q_update_totals
        INV-001: excess capital withdrawal only once per position (hasClaimedExcess flag)
        INV-002: amount deducted from both total and per-position invested capital
        INV-003: after withdrawal, investedCapital must equal cachedInvestAmount (verified by _verifyValidPosition)
        INV-004: signature validates the new investAmount and tokenAllocationRate
    end note
